calamares
flickos-installer

# Calamares needs it to make a btrfs filesystem; without it, choosing btrfs
# fails. Listed here (not a Depends of flickos-installer, which Calamares
# removes) so it stays installed and is never autoremoved: restore points
# need it on btrfs installs (docs/design/flickos-recovery.md, phase 1a).
btrfs-progs
